== Release Summary Information

=== Updated release content (gundas1)

Updated software change and release document.

=== Chnaged function LpsCalGetLastPayloadWeight to return last payload wt (gundas1)

Chnaged function LpsCalGetLastPayloadWeight to return last payload wt.

=== Removed NVM last payload weight assignment (gundas1)

Removed NVM last payload weight assignment.

=== Added function LpsCalGetLastPayloadWeight (gundas1)

Added function LpsCalGetLastPayloadWeight.

=== Added full rack check during the calibration (gundas1)

Added full rack check during the calibration. Reset cal weight and cal adjust when full cal success.

=== Moved private defines to public header file since wrapper needs access to them (gundas1)

Moved private defines to public header file since wrapper needs access to them.

